{
  "key": 40213,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "DWEternaForest_Text_CyrusHiveGrewIntoTheCeiling",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: The hive grew into the\n",
        "ceiling.\r",
        "So does the path. Walk where the\n",
        "honey is. Not where it was."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DWEternaForest_Text_CyrusWaitForIt",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: Wait for it. It comes back.\n",
        "Most things here do."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DWEternaForest_Text_GotCalmShard",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} got a Calm Shard!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DWEternaForest_Text_CyrusWhoeverDidThis",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: Whoever did this knew exactly\n",
        "how much a Pok\u00e9mon can bear\r",
        "before it breaks."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DWEternaForest_Text_CyrusSoDidIOnce",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: ...So did I, once."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DWEternaForest_Text_CyrusRuneHint",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: The runes flip you.\n",
        "Wall to ceiling. Ceiling\r",
        "to floor. Step off, then\n",
        "step on to flip back."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DWEternaForest_Text_CyrusSigilHint",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: Beside the rune sits\n",
        "a sigil. It raises the\r",
        "bridge. Cross while the\n",
        "honey holds."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
